cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use HealthGraphBench, cite this post-DOI benchmark release."
title: "HealthGraphBench: Incremental relational value in health-regulatory prediction"
authors:
  - name: "HealthGraphBench contributors"
version: 0.1.2
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/carabistouflette/HealthGraphBench"
url: "https://github.com/carabistouflette/HealthGraphBench/releases/tag/v0.1.2"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22765003"
commit: dcff32ee926c2e52f242fe0edb67381cff30b24a
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Frozen exploratory temporal evaluation of incremental relational predictive
  value in FDA MAUDE and CMS nursing-home inspection tasks, with strong simple
  baselines, a deterministic GraphSAGE comparison, entity-clustered uncertainty,
  and synthetic implementation sanity checks. Evaluation periods were inspected
  during development; results are not untouched prospective confirmation.
keywords:
  - benchmark
  - temporal evaluation
  - relational learning
  - public health
